message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Mathematical modeling of the effects of venous aspiration site and flow rate in post-traumatic intracranial hypertension: model code"
type: software
version: "2.0.1"
authors:
  - family-names: Assefa
    given-names: Adisu Mengesha
    affiliation: "Department of Biomechanics, University of Nebraska at Omaha"
